---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Main from '~/layouts/Main.astro';
import { posts, tools } from '~/collections';
const latestPost = posts[0]
const featuredTool = tools[0]
---

<Layout title="Security, intelligence, tooling">
    <Main title="Security, intelligence, tooling">
        <p class="my-14">Welcome to my corner of the web. Check out my latest blog post, <a href={`/blog/${latestPost.id}`}><em>{latestPost.data.title}</em></a> or check out my featured tool <a href={featuredTool.data.link}>{featuredTool.data.title}</a>.</p>
        <p>I am a cybersecurity professional and my love language is giving. Although I spend most of my professional time focussing on sharing intel in closed groups, I really enjoy giving back to the community through my tools and blog posts.</p>
    </Main>
</Layout>
<style>
    a {
  color: var(--color-sky-600)
}
</style>